Spec: specs/002-capture-and-canonical-events/spec.md (Store: Startup, Shutdown, Do; AC5, AC7, AC16, AC26, supports AC22, AC61)
Research: specs/002-capture-and-canonical-events/research.md Q12 (memory_peak_bytes in the capture stopped line), Q15 (XDG_DATA_HOME in the test helper, and the guard's proof), Q16 (event half of AC22 moves to T20), Q17 (AC16 proved as root too)
Why this approach: a nil-safe captureRun in run.go holds store, sink and budget, so capture off is a nil value and every path (bind failure, serve failed, timed-out and clean shutdown) calls the same stop/close. The store opens between the logger and listen, so a failure is the run's only line and nothing is bound. Recorded in plan.md ("Details fixed in T16").
Alternatives rejected: startGateway putting GATEWAY_CAPTURE_DIR in the env map, as the task line said (every GATEWAY_* var lands in the startup line's env_overrides, which 001's TestRun_StartupLine and TestRun_DefaultsWhenNoConfig assert), so the helper sets XDG_DATA_HOME instead (Q15); a chmod 0500 parent for AC16 with a skip under root (AC16 unproven as root, and AGENTS.md forbids skips), replaced by a capture.dir under a regular file plus a table of built errors (Q17); logging store.Open's error text (it can carry driver text), so a fixed reason is mapped from the error.
Trade-off / known limit: TestCapture_PrincipalLocal proves only the exchange half of AC22; with no parser until T20 it pins the messages exchange at parse skipped with no events, so T20's parser trips the pin and T20 turns it into a check that events exist and carry principal_id local (Q16). A real EACCES through run is not exercised in cmd/gateway (only internal/store's T10 subtest, which still skips as root). In-process tests read env from a map, so dropping the helper's line makes run exit 2 rather than tripping TestMain; TestMain catches the child binary and any future os-env path. TestMain points HOME at a temp dir, so binary_test.go gives go build the real HOME to keep its caches. Undrained exchanges don't change the exit code.
Verified by: make verify; go test -race on TestCapture_DisabledIsPassthrough, TestStore_OpenFailsFast uncreatable_dir / fixed_reasons, TestRun_DefaultCaptureDirUnresolvable, TestCapture_PrincipalLocal, TestCapture_ShutdownDrainsQueue queued_stored / stream_ends_during_server_shutdown / undrained_counted (with a capture/store goroutine leak check) and TestBinary_SignalShutdown; tests first failed to build on the missing deps.openStore. Mutations, each reverted: mapping ENOTDIR to the generic reason failed both TestStore_OpenFailsFast subtests; dropping the child's GATEWAY_CAPTURE_DIR made TestMain fail naming <tmp>/llm-gateway; dropping the helper's XDG_DATA_HOME failed 10 001 run tests; stopping capture before srv.Shutdown failed all three ShutdownDrainsQueue subtests. Every 001 cmd/gateway test passes with capture on, assertions unchanged.
